            "description": "<p>Describes the details about a specific instance when a query was run by the Amazon Redshift Data API. The information includes when the query started, when it finished, the query status, the number of rows returned, and the SQL statement. </p> <p>For more information about the Amazon Redshift Data API and CLI usage examples, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/redshift/latest/mgmt/data-api.html\">Using the Amazon Redshift Data API</a> in the <i>Amazon Redshift Management Guide</i>. </p>"
